      "indications_and_usage": [
        "Uses For the removal of common warts and plantar warts. Common warts have a rough \"cauliflower-like\" surface and are easily recognizable. Plantar warts are located only on the soles of the feet, tender to touch, with an interrupted footprint pattern."
      ],
      "warnings": [
        "Warnings For external use only."
      ],
      "do_not_use": [
        "Do not use on irritated skin or on any area that is infected or reddened. On moles, birthmarks, warts with hair growing from them, genital warts, or warts on the face or mucous membranes. If you have diabetes or poor blood circulation."
      ],
      "when_using": [
        "When Using Avoid contact with eyes. If product gets into the eyes, flush with water for 15 minutes. Non-edible. Cap tightly and store at room temperature, away from heat."
      ],
